PROMPT ============================================================
PROMPT DPS2 Phase 6 - Batch / Bulk Deposit Opening
PROMPT Version 0.6.0
PROMPT Scope: seed source-defined Batch references + HTML-aligned provisional error codes
PROMPT Existing operational tables are NOT recreated.
PROMPT ============================================================

-- Source-defined request type used by each normalized Batch item.
MERGE INTO DPS2.REF_DEP_OPEN_REQUEST_TYPE t
USING (SELECT 'BULK' REQUEST_TYPE_CODE, 'افتتاح گروهی' TITLE_FA, 'Bulk opening' TITLE_EN,
              'درخواست افتتاح تولیدشده از DEPOSIT_OPENING_BATCH_ITEM' DESCRIPTION, 30 DISPLAY_ORDER FROM DUAL) s
ON (t.REQUEST_TYPE_CODE=s.REQUEST_TYPE_CODE)
WHEN MATCHED THEN UPDATE SET t.TITLE_FA=s.TITLE_FA,t.TITLE_EN=s.TITLE_EN,t.DESCRIPTION=s.DESCRIPTION,t.DISPLAY_ORDER=s.DISPLAY_ORDER,t.IS_ACTIVE=1,t.UPDATED_AT=SYSTIMESTAMP,t.UPDATED_BY='MIGRATION_0.6.0'
WHEN NOT MATCHED THEN INSERT (REQUEST_TYPE_CODE,TITLE_FA,TITLE_EN,DESCRIPTION,DISPLAY_ORDER,IS_ACTIVE,CREATED_BY)
VALUES (s.REQUEST_TYPE_CODE,s.TITLE_FA,s.TITLE_EN,s.DESCRIPTION,s.DISPLAY_ORDER,1,'MIGRATION_0.6.0');

